<Learn
  title="India Atlas — Learn · Consumption: the biggest slice of GDP"
  description="Learn № 13 — private final consumption expenditure: what households actually buy. Well over half of Indian GDP, the quiet engine of growth, and the first place a slowdown in ordinary lives shows."
  slug="consumption-pfce"
  kicker="Learn № 13 — Growth · Consumption / PFCE"
  h1="The biggest slice of the economy <i>is your shopping.</i>"
  lede="Well over half of Indian GDP is households buying things: food, clothes, bus fares, school fees. PFCE is the quiet engine of the growth story, and the first place a slowdown in ordinary lives shows."
  meta={[
    ["Concept", "Consumption · PFCE"],
    ["Illustrated with", "Real PFCE · Q1 FY17 – Q2 FY26"],
    ["Source", "MoSPI, NSO"],
    ["Level", "First principles"],
